  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WISER - Research and Evidence Divisions programme (RDEL) investment to improve weather early warning systems and inform better agriculture decisons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity WISER - Research and Evidence Divisions programme (RDEL) investment to improve weather early warning systems and inform better agriculture decisons is a component of WISER - Weather and climate Information and SERvices for Africa reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,550,000. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Disaster prevention and preparedness, Environmental research, Food assistance, Water sector policy and administrative management, Social Protection, Agricultural policy and administrative management, Malaria control.</narrative>
  </description>
